<title>ISRAEL: At least 3 feared dead in Tel Aviv bombing.</title>
<headline>At least 3 feared dead in Tel Aviv bombing.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb ripped through a sidewalk cafe in Tel Aviv on Friday killing up to three people, witnesses and Israeli army radio said.</p>
<p>Public Security Minister Avigdor Kahalani blamed the blast on Arab guerrillas. Up to 30 people were wounded.</p>
</text>
